<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Ice Thorn</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 17)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast ice thorn
</pre>
<p>No true druid need ever be without a weapon. The caster whispers the word 
'Gelidus', the air hisses with a burst of cold, and a dagger of ice takes 
shape in your hands; you find it in your inventory. Wield it like any 
dagger.
</p><p>The better your skill in the spell and your divine power, the finer the 
dagger: its craftsmanship and its magic both grow with them, up to +15 
(see <a cmd='#'>Help Craftsmanship</a>). But it melts. It lasts about twenty minutes, 
and it grows weaker as it goes: after seven minutes it begins to melt, 
after fourteen it drips steadily, and then it is gone.
</p><p>You must be standing to cast it. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Dagger</a>
